{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Collection Simulator is focused around opening Card Packs live on an in-game Stream and selling your Cards at the local Convention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/88f42b67133679bb3f79ed319f1b54d8.avif?t=1765917201\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Your Stream:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day you can open Card Packs on Stream, and your growing Community will share the excitement with you!  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/5f780e37859917c79ce13ef9b805e382.avif?t=1765917201\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run your own Booth:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head to the local Convention to sell your Cards, then buy Packs for more fun on Stream! Will you only sell Duplicate Cards or will you part with the most valuable pieces of your Collection?  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353700/extras/43f7704d8234c2e08ac92ac2aa248418.avif?t=1765917201\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Them All!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Quest has hundreds of unique Cards to collect! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two separate Trading Card Games: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alienmon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes vs Villains</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each TCG comes with different Packs and Cards of various Rarities! Can you collect them all?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_